  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.2\n            - Added support for ValueTuple arguments by enabling field serialization in OutboxJob JSON handling\n            - Improved OutboxJob argument deserialization to avoid repeated enumeration during serialization/deserialization\n            - Added unit test coverage for configuration, cleanup, outbox job handling, and outbox processing\n            - Updated package metadata and repository links, removed PackageLicenseUrl, and upgraded Hangfire.Core to 1.8.23\n            - Added a GitHub Actions release workflow to build, test, pack, and publish the NuGet package with NuGet Trusted Publishing",
